it was a gloomy October morning a man  and his two sons went fishing in the  woods that stretched miles beyond their  own backyard  his wife watched from the kitchen window  as they disappeared into the trees hours  passed and the wife began to worry she  had not heard from her family since they  had left in the morning the dinner she  had prepared for them had gone cold  after another hour of waiting she  decided to go out and look for them by  now it was almost completely dark she  ran through the woods calling out their  names but there was no reply it was some  time before she came across a stream but  there lay the bodies of her husband and  oldest son with a knife stuck in each  one of their chests it was obvious that  they had been murdered she continued to  look for her youngest son surely an 11  year old boy could not survive alone in  the woods for long it was too dark and  she could not see anything after morning  her husband and son she decided to head  back home she now realized that the  person who killed her two family members  was still out there in the woods  terrified out of her wits  she ran frantically through the woods  until she reached her home when she  arrived she told her neighbor what had  happened but swore her to secrecy as she  did not want the events of today to be  known by anyone else the next day her  neighbor helped her smuggle the bodies  out of the stream and together they  buried them both in the woods the woman  was still in search of her youngest son  she had searched the woods the entire  morning and found no trace of him she  hoped he had found shelter and would  return to her when he knew it was safe  she had been digging her husband's and  son's grave all day and she was  exhausted from the work when she had  finished digging her neighbor offered to  go back into the house and retrieve two  blankets in order to wrap their bodies  the woman agreed and suggested that she  took them from her bed nearly 3/4 of an  hour had passed and the neighbor had  still not returned  the woman decided to go back to see if  her neighbor was okay as she arrived she  began to climb her stairs she opened her  bedroom door and was horrified at the  sight she screamed for there on her bed  near the open window was the severed  head of her youngest son and a knife the  neighbor nowhere to be found  if you've enjoyed this video then please  go ahead and leave it a like consider  subscribing if folklore mythology is  something that interests you if you have  anything you'd like to discuss or have  any ideas for future videos then please  go ahead and let me know in the comments  below as always I've been your host  mythology and folklore explained
 

